From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:02:22 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 84/94] dt-bindings: interconnect: qcom,msm8998-bwmon: Add
 SDM660 CPU BWMON

SDM630/SDM660 have the same BWMON v4 instance as MSM8998 between the
CPU and the BIMC: monitor registers at the start of the BIMC block
(0x01008000), the global interrupt registers in a separate region
(0x01001000), downstream compatible qcom,bimc-bwmon4. Add a
SoC-specific compatible with qcom,msm8998-bwmon as the fallback, and
match the two-region constraint with "contains" so it covers the
fallback form too.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SXjPGasJxD6XRYU1J9jsnW
---
 .../bindings/interconnect/qcom,msm8998-bwmon.yaml          | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/interconnect/qcom,msm8998-bwmon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/interconnect/qcom,msm8998-bwmon.yaml
index ff64225e8..4e65f56a8 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/interconnect/qcom,msm8998-bwmon.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/interconnect/qcom,msm8998-bwmon.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,10 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
       - const: qcom,msm8998-bwmon       # BWMON v4
+      - items:
+          - enum:
+              - qcom,sdm660-cpu-bwmon
+          - const: qcom,msm8998-bwmon
       - items:
           - enum:
               - qcom,glymur-cpu-bwmon
@@ -95,7 +99,8 @@ allOf:
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
-          const: qcom,msm8998-bwmon
+          contains:
+            const: qcom,msm8998-bwmon
     then:
       properties:
         reg:
